{"intent": "this MCU can bring SPI out on two different pin groups — let the assignment pick which", "expected_skill": "jitx-pin-assignment"}
{"intent": "attach the STEP model to this connector and export the board outline to DXF for the ME team", "expected_skill": "jitx-mechanical"}
